body: "{\n  \"sprint\": \"8.4\",\n  \"title\": \"PyO3 expansion — AnchoredValue exposed to Python pipeline\",\n  \"date\": \"2026-05-24\",\n  \"status\": \"COMPLETE\",\n  \"composite_score\": 1.0,\n  \"deliverables\": {\n    \"parser_registry\": {\n      \"file\": \"src/mef_rail/parser_registry.rs\",\n      \"loc\": 175,\n      \"tests\": 6,\n      \"dispatched_parsers\": 27,\n      \"exports\": [\"parser_for_sheet\", \"all_known_sheet_names\", \"audit_trail_line\"]\n    },\n    \"workbook_py_extended\": {\n      \"file\": \"src/mef_rail/workbook_py.rs\",\n      \"loc_added\": 200,\n      \"new_methods\": [\n        \"extract_canonical(sheet_name) -> List[Dict]\",\n        \"cell_at(sheet, addr) -> Optional[Dict]\",\n        \"audit_trail(av_dict) -> str\",\n        \"get_formulas(sheet) -> Dict[str, str]\",\n        \"list_known_sheets() -> List[str]\"\n      ]\n    }\n  },\n  \"metrics\": {\n    \"lib_tests_total\": 134,\n    \"lib_tests_added_sprint_8_4\": 6,\n    \"compile_time_clean_secs\": 3.59,\n    \"features_validated\": [\"mef-rail\", \"pyo3\"],\n    \"anchored_values_exposed_extrapolated\": 68000\n  },\n  \"lessons\": [\n    {\n      \"id\": \"L46\",\n      \"title\": \"Existing source code é pattern reference suficiente quando idiom estabelecido\",\n      \"context\": \"Sprint 8.4 era PyO3 expansion — primeira tentação era query Context7 para 0.21+ patterns. Mas existing workbook_py.rs JÁ usava Bound<'py, PyDict> + PyDict::new(py) + Vec<Bound<PyDict>>. Lendo o source 1× = pattern aprendido. Skip Context7 query economizou ~5KB context budget. Lição: query external docs SÓ quando o pattern não existe in-house.\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"next_sprint\": \"8.5 — Cross-corridor diff (workbook_diff, consolidate_multi_corridor). ~350 LOC + 15 tests. Consumes parser_registry to compare AnchoredValues across 3 corredores.\",\n  \"hash_chain_predecessor\": \"2026-05-24-sprint8-3-long-tail-block-complete-27of27.toon\"\n}\n"
